# What tauri-cli's AppImage bundler fetches from GitHub releases at bundle time, pinned by
# the SHA-256 GitHub lists for each asset (tauri-tools.sh fetches them; the Linux app job and
# desktop-release.yml's Linux legs run it). One line each: KIND ARCH SHA256 URL.
#
# apprun, linuxdeploy: the two names tauri-cli 2.12.3 looks for (appimage/linuxdeploy.rs:
#   apprun-old, linuxdeploy-07333c6), checked by nothing in tauri.
# plugin: linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage, which tauri takes from its `continuous` release only
#   (no tagged build exists). The pin is the build of 2026-10-01; when `continuous` moves,
#   tauri-tools.sh warns and leaves it to tauri, as it did before.
# runtime: the AppImage type2 runtime that appimagetool (inside the plugin) otherwise
#   downloads from type2-runtime's `continuous` release while it bundles, with no retry and
#   no checksum. Pinned to the tagged release 20251108 and handed to appimagetool by
#   LDAI_RUNTIME_FILE (the plugin passes it on as --runtime-file), so it downloads nothing.
apprun x86_64 f30140a43a0a59e46db21bdefdf749b9e9f2c6946e92afabbacf98b8ae73fb4f https://github.com/tauri-apps/binary-releases/releases/download/apprun-old/AppRun-x86_64
apprun aarch64 072f17c0895a85c490282fe5395c5007e5fc75da727e553b3b8fb680feb11578 https://github.com/tauri-apps/binary-releases/releases/download/apprun-old/AppRun-aarch64
linuxdeploy x86_64 36a2d7e274d12e1050d0e9ecfe11d339ed54720b2bec464c286d53f8b07f5c62 https://github.com/tauri-apps/binary-releases/releases/download/linuxdeploy-07333c6/linuxdeploy-x86_64.AppImage
linuxdeploy aarch64 556ab80baa98e600aa80f0dcedfb70bca0e1ce7e9f147fb345be3fcc3e91b2b1 https://github.com/tauri-apps/binary-releases/releases/download/linuxdeploy-07333c6/linuxdeploy-aarch64.AppImage
plugin x86_64 49d6a17160675a6bd1781699aae6bdf7692d98552e02a3671d2183d10547842e https://github.com/linuxdeploy/linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage/releases/download/continuous/linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage-x86_64.AppImage
plugin aarch64 518f4b49a561c157b23fd1ba4e857b8fa2271a038ac711bdedab6f018acbe7e5 https://github.com/linuxdeploy/linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage/releases/download/continuous/linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage-aarch64.AppImage
runtime x86_64 2fca8b443c92510f1483a883f60061ad09b46b978b2631c807cd873a47ec260d https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime/releases/download/20251108/runtime-x86_64
runtime aarch64 00cbdfcf917cc6c0ff6d3347d59e0ca1f7f45a6df1a428a0d6d8a78664d87444 https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime/releases/download/20251108/runtime-aarch64
